{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Let's Go Mushroom Hunting&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know the wonders of mushrooms?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience of discovering mushrooms in nature is truly unparalleled. It's like finding treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought about it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those of you who go out into nature and forage for them yourself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've prepared this game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is about a mushroom farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find mushrooms and dig them up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching them grow in a calm and comfortable manner will give you a satisfying dopamine rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that's great for clearing your mind and finding healing through labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farming Mushroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you find mushrooms, you'll need to gather them yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading each part will help you grow faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase a pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will greatly aid you in finding mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final mushroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey has an ending, leaving a lasting impression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the final ending, even if you don't know where it will end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044690?t=1758584281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044690?t=1758584281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044690/5e3cec662931d117b12d69ef5b6739b0facf3b86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758584281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044690/5e3cec662931d117b12d69ef5b6739b0facf3b86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758584281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Let's Go Mushroom Hunting&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know the wonders of mushrooms?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience of discovering mushrooms in nature is truly unparalleled. It's like finding treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought about it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those of you who go out into nature and forage for them yourself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've prepared this game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is about a mushroom farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find mushrooms and dig them up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching them grow in a calm and comfortable manner will give you a satisfying dopamine rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game that's great for clearing your mind and finding healing through labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farming Mushroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you find mushrooms, you'll need to gather them yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading each part will help you grow faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase a pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets will greatly aid you in finding mushrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final mushroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey has an ending, leaving a lasting impression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the final ending, even if you don't know where it will end.</p>","developers":["KIMJUIM"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044690/668365e6e9749309bc6c3208cf5b86b9caf03b93/header.jpg?t=1758584281","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044690/1899381710/808d2f6d7d371de91e645f29689f385409e1afcc/1758512104/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758584278","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044690/1899381710/808d2f6d7d371de91e645f29689f385409e1afcc/1758512104/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758584278","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044690/1899381710/808d2f6d7d371de91e645f29689f385409e1afcc/1758512104/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758584278","id":257203667,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203667/movie480.mp4?t=1758584278","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203667/movie_max.mp4?t=1758584278"},"name":"Farming Mushroom","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203667/cb66b66de3c3046d048c63de4916ef2fff5fa3fa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758584278","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203667/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758584278","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203667/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758584278"}}],"name":"Farming Mushroom","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or other shader model 4.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["KIMJUIM"]